== Notes ==
* Floors affected by {{cu|Labyrinth}} are counted as the first floor by Pandora's Box.
* {{dlc|a}} When playing [[Greed Mode]], the normal [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room item pool]] is still used in Sheol, instead of the [[Devil Room (Greed Mode Item Pool)|Greed Mode Devil Room item pool]].
* {{dlc+|a+}} In [[Greed Mode]], it will always generate its 2nd floor drops for each Chapter that is before the {{s|Womb}}, such as 20 pennies in the {{s|Depths}}, etc.{{dlc-}}
** The {{s|Womb}} is the exception, generating its 1st floor drop: 2 Boss Room items.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Ascent]] floors give the rewards of their regular floors.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Belial synergy|description=In addition to the item's expected reward, spawns one of the following demonic familiars: {{i|Blood Puppy}}, {{i|Dark Bum}}, {{i|Demon Baby}}, {{i|Incubus}}, {{i|Lil Abaddon}}, {{i|Lil Brimstone}}, {{i|Succubus}}, or {{i|Twisted Pair}}.}}
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns <code>floor - 1</code> regular wisps with no unique effect, up to a maximum of 8. No wisps are spawned on the first floor.}}
* {{t|Strange Key}}: Instead of its normal effect, Pandora's Box spawns six items from a set of item pools. Both items are consumed.
** This will prevent unlocking {{I|Moving Box|n}} if it hasn't already been unlocked, when used in {{S|Dark Room}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{p|? Card}}:
** {{dlc|anr}} Will consume both the card and Pandora's Box, but nothing will happen, wasting both of them.
** {{dlc|r}} Will activate Pandora's Box without consuming it, allowing for multiple activations.
** {{Dlc|r}} If Isaac is holding {{T|Strange Key|n}}, using the ? Card will consume the card and trinket, spawning 6 items, but Pandora's Box will not be consumed.
* {{I|Void}} After Pandora's Box is absorbed by Void, using Void again while holding {{T|Strange Key|n}} will spawn 6 items. Strange key will be consumed.

