== Trivia ==
* In Greek legend, [[wikipedia:Pandora's Box|''Pandora's Box'']] is a jar containing all of the evils of the world. It was given to the first woman created, who, in her curiosity, opened it, releasing every evil unto the land. Once the evils were released, the only thing that remained was Elpis, the Spirit of Hope.
* Pandora's Box, along with {{t|Strange Key}}, is likely a reference to David Lynch's 2001 film ''[[wikipedia:Mulholland Drive (film)|Mulholland Drive]].''
* The rewards for Greed Mode changed in patch [[v1.06.J168]]; the rewards given in {{s|Caves}} are instead given in {{s|Basement}}, and so on.
* Despite Pandora’s Box’s sprite depicting a keylock, the item does not require a key to open.
* Pandora's Box is named '''Blue Box''' both in the game files and on Edmund McMillen's development notes, as it was likely an early name for the item.
** Paradoxically, {{I|Box of Friends}}' sprite in the game files is named '''Pandora’s Box''', despite the fact it was added to the game after Pandora's Box.

